<title>USA: ENVIROTEST EXTENDS CONSENT SOLICITATION.</title>
<headline>ENVIROTEST EXTENDS CONSENT SOLICITATION.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Envirotest Systems Corp said Monday it has extended the expiration date of its previously announced consent solicitation on proposed amendments to the indentures governing its 9.125 percent senior notes due 2001 and 9.625 percent percent senior subordinated notes due 2003 to August 18.</p>
<p>Envirotest also said the consent solicitation has been revised to provide that the proposed amendments would become operative if and when an offer by it to purchase up to $50 million of the 9.125 percent notes notes expired.</p>
<p>Envirotest provides vehicle inspection services both in the U,S and abroad.</p>
</text>
